    <title>Episode 21 重生之我做恋综观察室嘉宾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a06c19be1eb34a93973afb5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a06c19be1eb34a93973afb5</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 15 May 2026 07:05:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>停更一年终于回归！本期和xhs新认识的朋友三顺一起热聊爆款韩综《单身即地狱》第五季（属于是末班车了bhys。。。从嘉宾初印象，再到抓马感情线以及各种名场面，虽然已经离完播过去了一万年，但重新聊起来还是会滔滔不绝！</span></p><p><span>本期嘉宾：@敏敏、@三顺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:08</a> 开播致歉与复更说明</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">01:57</a> 三顺也是老韩剧人了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="421">07:01</a> 男嘉宾初印象盘点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1128">18:48</a> 女嘉宾初印象盘点</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 崔美娜秀与那些男人们的爱恨纠葛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2598">43:18</a> 篝火晚会名场面吐槽向</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3645">01:00:45</a> 背后蛐蛐所有女生真的很让人下头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4012">01:06:52</a> 其他cp感情线复盘</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4900">01:21:40</a> 韩娱内娱恋综对比，忆江南的含金量还在持续上升！</span></p><p><span>BGM: At Last - chengcheng/JASMINE</span></p><p><span>👇转自xhs@cannon</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2txw2kL4hUrVIUQnsbkkq1H8Ma.JPG"></figure><p><span>👇转自xhs@kk的学习日记（更多其他组写真大家可以去自己搜一下～）</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsDmOKwgx57xZLM2PEG5KX-AWXmG.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
