  <item>
    <title>Episode 20：我们在《好东西》里看到性别，爱和自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67fd4b33991f9ddd763bce81</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67fd4b33991f9ddd763bce81</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Apr 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽大家好！好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是拖了非常久的一期。其实《好东西》刚上映我们去看完就迫不及待的录了，聊得零零碎碎，更像是两个朋友的闲谈，争论和理解。</span></p><span></span><p><span>春天来了！希望大家也可以和朋友多聊天，多见面，多感受风，多感受爱~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播及嘉宾：@vv @Nichole</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="144">02:24</a> 女孩应该做的到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 被小孩融化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 一个性别的强大并不需要通过打压另一个性别来凸显</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 事业的课题也不能覆盖爱的课题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1166">19:26</a> 铁梅对情感的变化可能是需求排序的变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1395">23:15</a> “我很欣喜看到她的转变，但我任然觉得前一部分的她也是好的”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1568">26:08</a> 爱的教育到底是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1753">29:13</a> 长得帅的男生是更会恋爱的吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2127">35:27</a> 异性说了什么话会让你不喜欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2221">37:01</a> （穿插一个题外话：我们为什么会喜欢历史）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2368">39:28</a> 推荐罗振宇老师的节目《罗振宇文明之旅》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2412">40:12</a> 对三个男性角色的理解</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/640a454dfde2f8b60b695952/ljuAQz7ONKSGWbjarUD1W5e9N_zq.m4a" length="49594355" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:51:20</itunes:duration>
